mlx-serve absorbed mlx-stream into its server (mlx-serve's NOTICE at that commit). Of what src/mlx_serve/ copies from
mlx-serve, that is the SSD expert streamer, its SDK and C shims (sdk/weights/streamed/, module `mlx_stream`:
scripts/slice-stream.txt). mlx-serve's NOTICE carries mlx-stream's full entry.

