overlay/mlx_serve/kernels/mla/ling_verify_mla_1p.metal, ling_verify_mla_2p1.metal and ling_verify_mla_2p2.metal are
MLX 0.32.5's `sdpa_vector`, `sdpa_vector_2pass_1` and `sdpa_vector_2pass_2`
(mlx/backend/metal/kernels/sdpa_vector.h) less their mask, sinks and window arms, their parameters read from the
operands, run for several query rows in one launch (overlay/mlx_serve/plugins/bailing_hybrid/verify_rows.zig takes
MLX's choice of pass and blocks from scaled_dot_product_attention.cpp).
ling_verify_mla_1p_r1.metal and ling_verify_mla_2p1_r1.metal are the same two kernels with a key element read from
each head's nope keys or the token's one roped key (the rope-once cache, src/ling_mla_rope1.zig).

